Subject: [PATCH 2340/3799] soh: rename func_8097AA60 ->
 DemoGj_CheckRisingPile6

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: once Ganondorf starts rising, launches rubble pile 6 and switches it to update mode 13
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gj/z_demo_gj.c
index d2825a3cc..b41c72a07 100644
